# === Secrets & backups — never commit (added for claude-config bundle) ===
# Backups often hold un-redacted snapshots of files that were later cleaned
*.bak
*.bak-*
*~

# The plaintext credential reference file — pull these from Bitwarden instead
credentials.md
**/credentials.md

# The memory folder is a live secret store — NEVER commit it. Transfer machine-to-machine.
claude-config/memory/
**/projects/*/memory/

# Files whose names indicate secrets
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pkcs12
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.ppk
*.token
*token.pickle
*.bw_session
.bw_session
*secret*
*secrets*
*credential*
*credentials*
